repository-code: "https://github.com/lingsenyou/panvas-buddy"
url: "https://lingsenyou.com/suitcordance/"
abstract: >-
  A suitcordance operator that treats device-vessel failure as a property of the
  agreement between device and vessel rather than of either alone. Four axes -
  geometric, mechanical, hemodynamic and biological - combine as a bed-weighted
  geometric mean and evolve in time, yielding a time constant and a time-averaged
  mismatch dose. Eleven of thirteen free constants are calibrated as one shared
  parameter set against published 12-month event rates spanning six arterial beds.
  Ships with an editable device-selection harness, an in-silico evaluation including
  a reported null result on cross-bed transfer, and a browser workbench.
  Research prototype; not validated in patients; not a clinical decision tool.
